 CBErrEwc msg;⎕TRAP;errT;errCaller;errMode;errCase
⍝ DemoCallbackErrors: the EWC case - a nested eDQ on F2, whose buttons'
⍝ callbacks fail, with the application's ⎕TRAP localised here
 errMode errCaller errCase←'ewc' 'CBErrEwc' '?'
 'F2'eWC'Form' 'Make a callback fail'(200 50)(48 460)('Coord' 'Pixel')
 'F2.TOP'eWC'Button' '⎕SIGNAL in callback'(12 12)(24 215)('Event' 'Select' 'CBErrTop')
 'F2.DEEP'eWC'Button' 'Error deeper down'(12 233)(24 215)('Event' 'Select' 'CBErrDeep')
 ⎕TRAP←0 'E'((⍕⎕THIS),'.CBErrRec ⋄ ',(⍕⎕THIS),'.eEX''F2'' ⋄ →0')
 errT←⍴⎕LC
 {}eDQ'F2'
